fill_in_blanks: In 1969, ___ became the first person to walk on the ___.
!<hint>[A nudge (-1)](He said something about a small step.)
{
=Armstrong
=Moon
~Aldrin
~Mars
}
:points_correct=2

fill_in_blanks: No word bank here — type it. A ___ of lions, a ___ of geese, a ___ of fish.
!<analysis>[Why?](answer_mode=type drops the bank entirely, so this is recall rather than recognition. typo_tolerance keeps a near-miss spelling from being marked wrong.)
{
=pride
=gaggle
=school
}
:answer_mode=type
:typo_tolerance=30
